WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.320
- I always like to end this show

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:03.060
with a feel good story from the internet.

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:04.400
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.420
(upbeat music)

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:07.140
(crowd cheering)

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.900
A kindergartner from Georgia
has become an unlikely leader

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.760
in the fight for workers' rights.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.830
This is six year old Brody.

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:14.663
It's incredible.

00:00:14.663 --> 00:00:17.460
A few weeks ago, he took to
social media with an idea

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:19.781
a lot of people can get behind.

00:00:19.781 --> 00:00:23.910
- Hey, I'm Brody, and this
is for the government.

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:25.890
And I'm protesting,

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:29.580
and I want three days off of school.

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:30.903
Because, um,

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.650
I've been tired of school lately,

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:37.473
and I've been dreaming for three days off.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:42.540
Two days is not enough from school.

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:44.610
I need three days off.

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:46.860
I need time to just play

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:51.860
and go with Nana and stay home

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:53.947
and do whatever I want.

00:00:53.947 --> 00:00:55.181
(crowd cheering)

00:00:55.181 --> 00:00:57.240
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:58.083
- Preach, Brody.

00:00:59.289 --> 00:01:00.900
This is not a joke.

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:03.510
Brody started a petition on change.org

00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:06.150
that's already garnered
a thousand signatures.

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:08.550
I don't know how there's not
more from all other kids.

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:10.710
Let's get him in here
with his mama Jessica.

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:12.039
What's up y'all?

00:01:12.039 --> 00:01:13.440
(crowd cheering)

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:15.300
- Hey, how are you?

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:17.640
- Oh, my gosh. I love your family.

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:19.650
First of all, thank you
for coming on our show!

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:22.080
Brody, a lot of people are behind you.

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:25.140
So what inspired this video?
You just needed a break.

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:29.777
- Yeah, and I think
everybody needs one. And...

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:31.823
- [Kelly] Yes!

00:01:31.823 --> 00:01:34.413
- I guess they're getting
tired of school, too.

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:37.000
- You are so cute, dude. You are.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.280
- Thank you.

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:39.780
- Alright. Well, Jessica, is it true

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:41.790
that people want Brody
to run for president?

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:43.040
'Cause I will vote for him.

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:43.873
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:43.873 --> 00:01:46.230
- Yes, that is what everybody's saying.

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:48.810
And it's so funny, because
we've always been told

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:51.690
Brody's gonna grow up to be something big,

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:53.310
like the president.

00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:56.310
I just didn't expect for nominations

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:58.486
to start rolling in at six years old.

00:01:58.486 --> 00:02:00.120
(Kelly laughing)

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.830
- Oh my god. Dream big is what I say.

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:04.950
So Brody, you have some
other campaign promises.

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:06.499
So what are they?

00:02:06.499 --> 00:02:10.380
- Give everybody ice
cream sundaes every day

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:14.257
and build the biggest swimming
pool in their backyard.

00:02:14.257 --> 00:02:15.168
(crowd cheering)

00:02:15.168 --> 00:02:17.160
(Kelly laughing and clapping)

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:18.510
- Oh my gosh.

00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:21.150
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:22.110
And that's not all!

00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:24.870
Our season long partner
Pilot, pen makers of G2,

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:26.460
the go-to pen of the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:29.520
want to celebrate inspiring
kids just like you, Brody.

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:31.050
So they're gonna be writing you a check

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.160
for a thousand dollars.

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:36.550
Considerate an early
campaign contribution.

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:38.640
Bye, y'all! Have a blessed day!

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:39.989
And thank you to all our guests,

00:02:39.989 --> 00:02:42.899
Zachary Levi, Lainey Wilson,
Hannah Fry, Jay Leno,

00:02:42.899 --> 00:02:44.070
and Novi Brown.

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:46.893
Y'all have a great day, and if
it's not, try and change it.

